# Notes for Calendar Connect

Copy this file to `src/CONTEXT.md` and make it yours. Everything in it is
appended to both system prompts, so the model reads it before every message.
Delete the file (or leave it out) and nothing changes — the bot behaves as it
always did.

It is plain markdown; the headings below are only a suggestion. Write it the
way you'd brief a new assistant, and keep it short — every line is sent on
every message.

## People

- Sam is my manager. "1:1" with no name means my 1:1 with Sam.
- Alex is my partner. Anything with Alex is personal, not work.

## Places

- "the office" is 100 Summer St, Boston.
- "the gym" is the YMCA on Huntington Ave.
- "home" means I'm remote; leave the location empty for it.

## Routines

- Standup is every weekday at 9:15am and runs 15 minutes.
- I don't book work meetings before 9am or after 6pm.
- "Lunch" is 45 minutes unless I say otherwise.

## My shorthand

- "PT" is physical therapy, always 1 hour.
- "the sync" is the Thursday platform sync.
- "EOD" means an all-day event on that day, not 5pm.
